Here is a correct MCP tool invocation. Note that every tool is called through the same tools/call method, with the specific tool addressed by name:
MCP request:
{
jsonrpc: 2.0,
id: 2,
method: tools/call,
params: {
name: get_weather,
arguments: { location: New York }
}
}
MCP response:
{
jsonrpc: 2.0,
id: 2,
result: {
content: [
{ type: text, text: Current weather in New York: 72°F, Partly cloudy }
],
isError: false
}
}
Tools also declare a structured inputSchema (JSON Schema) and optionally an outputSchema for validated str

